  "desc": "<a href=\"https://github.com/anki-geo/hardcore-geography/\"><b>FULL DESCRIPTION</b></a> | <a href=\"https://github.com/anki-geo/hardcore-geography/releases\"><b>RELEASE NOTES</b></a> | <a href=\"https://github.com/anki-geo/hardcore-geography/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md\"><b>CONTRIBUTING</b></a>\n\n<b>Hardcore Geography</b> is a companion add-on for Ultimate Geography. It contains supplemental territories and region cards that can be installed alongside standard Ultimate Geography without taking ownership of UG notes.\n",
